 # Changelog
 
+## 1.5.0 (2026-11-15)
+
+- Persist fixed response deadlines with configurable priority hours and startup backfill.
+- Gate due responses and overdue listings with `DUE_TIMES=on`; retain version 1 data for rollback.
+- Show enabled deadlines in operator output, preserving the existing raw column positions.
+- Assign active tickets with `PUT /tickets/:id/assignee`; audit changes and notify each new assignee.
+- Filter by assignee, including unassigned tickets; combine all listing filters.
+- Persist assignees and show them in command-line output; preserve the first four raw columns.
+
+- Atomic `POST /tickets/import` batches of up to 5000 tickets, with ordered ids, audit entries and requester notifications.
+- Imports save the complete batch once; invalid items report their zero-based index without changes.
+
 ## 1.4.0 (2025-09-15)
 
 - The operator command line, `bin/tickets.js` (`list`, `show`), and the weekly report, `scripts/weekly-report.js`.
