+## Due times
+
+With `DUE_TIMES=on`, all ticket responses include `due`, an ISO timestamp fixed at creation.
+`GET /tickets?overdue=true` selects only open and in-progress tickets with `due` strictly earlier than the current time, before cursor pagination. Existing status, priority and assignee filters still apply with their existing semantics.
